{"v":2,"s":"m","w":3,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"What a fraction is","b":"<p>In a/b, <b>b</b> (denominator, imenilac) says how many equal parts the whole is cut into, and <b>a</b> (numerator, brojilac) how many parts you take.</p><p><b>Reduce</b> (skrati) by dividing top and bottom by their NZD: 18/24 = 3/4. <b>Expand</b> (proširi) by multiplying both: 3/4 = 9/12.</p><p>Mixed number to improper fraction: 2½ = (2·2 + 1)/2 = 5/2.</p>"},{"t":"read","h":"Operations","b":"<ul><li><b>Add / subtract</b>: bring to a common denominator (the NZS), then add the numerators. 1/2 + 1/3 = 3/6 + 2/6 = 5/6</li><li><b>Multiply</b>: top × top, bottom × bottom (reduce first if you can). 2/3 · 9/10 = 18/30 = 3/5</li><li><b>Divide</b>: multiply by the reciprocal. a/b : c/d = a/b · d/c</li></ul><div class=\"callout\">Pizza slices: before adding halves and thirds, cut both pizzas into sixths.</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1/2 + 1/3: cut both into sixths first, then add the slices.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M48 50L48.0 14.0A36 36 0 0 1 79.2 32.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M48 50L79.2 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 79.2 68.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M48 50L79.2 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 48.0 86.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M48 50L48.0 86.0A36 36 0 0 1 16.8 68.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><path d=\"M48 50L16.8 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 16.8 32.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><path d=\"M48 50L16.8 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 48.0 14.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"20\">+</text><path d=\"M160 50L160.0 14.0A36 36 0 0 1 191.2 32.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M160 50L191.2 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 191.2 68.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M160 50L191.2 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 160.0 86.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><path d=\"M160 50L160.0 86.0A36 36 0 0 1 128.8 68.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><path d=\"M160 50L128.8 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 128.8 32.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><path d=\"M160 50L128.8 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 160.0 14.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"216\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"20\">=</text><path d=\"M272 50L272.0 14.0A36 36 0 0 1 303.2 32.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M272 50L303.2 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 303.2 68.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M272 50L303.2 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 272.0 86.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M272 50L272.0 86.0A36 36 0 0 1 240.8 68.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M272 50L240.8 68.0A36 36 0 0 1 240.8 32.0Z\" class=\"a\"/><path d=\"M272 50L240.8 32.0A36 36 0 0 1 272.0 14.0Z\" class=\"sf\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"108\" >1/2 = 3/6</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"108\" >1/3 = 2/6</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"108\" font-weight=\"700\">5/6</text></svg><figcaption>1/2 + 1/3: cut both into sixths first, then add the slices.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Decimals","b":"<p>Decimal ↔ fraction: 0.75 = 75/100 = 3/4; 0.6 = 6/10 = 3/5. Some fractions give repeating decimals: 1/3 = 0.333…</p><p>To compare fractions, turn them into decimals or a common denominator.</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"2½ : 5/6","s":["Turn into an improper fraction: 2½ = 5/2.","Divide = multiply by the reciprocal: 5/2 · 6/5.","Cancel: (5·6)/(2·5) = 6/2 = 3."],"a":"3"},{"t":"mc","q":"3/4 − 1/6 = ?","o":["2/2","7/12","1/2","5/12"],"a":1,"e":"9/12 − 2/12 = 7/12."},{"t":"mc","q":"2/3 · 9/10 = ?","o":["3/5","18/13","11/13","6/10"],"a":0,"e":"18/30 = 3/5."},{"t":"mc","q":"0.6 as a fraction:","o":["6/100","3/5","2/3","1/6"],"a":1,"e":"6/10 = 3/5."},{"t":"num","q":"1¼ : 5/8 = ?","a":2,"u":"","e":"5/4 · 8/5 = 2."},{"t":"mc","q":"Reduce 18/24:","o":["9/16","3/4","6/8","2/3"],"a":1,"e":"NZD = 6."}]}